  "content": {
    "en": "Prestige UI is a curated library of animated React components, ambient backgrounds, and full-page landing blocks built with Tailwind CSS and Motion. Designed with a luxury aesthetic and subtle micro-interactions, it integrates seamlessly with the shadcn CLI ecosystem, allowing developers to copy-paste or install production-ready UI elements directly into modern Next.js applications.",
    "zh": "Prestige UI 是一套专注于奢华质感与细腻微交互的现代 React 动效组件与整页区块合集。基于 Tailwind CSS 与 Motion 构建，涵盖光影按钮、交互式导航、流体背景与着陆页模块，并完全兼容 shadcn CLI 注册表生态，支持将源代码无缝拉取至 Next.js 项目中随心定制。"
  },
